# Sample data kept for reference but read by no server code. Confirmed with
# `grep -rn "<name>" src/ test/ scripts/` — the only files under data/ the
# running server opens are acc.json, accounts.json, first.json, lboard.json,
# build-number and the database it creates itself. These six stay in the
# repository as reference material; they just stop being installed on the
# server, where nothing would ever read them.
data/acc-backup.json
data/acc-new-units.json
data/battle.json
data/battlereadyData.json
data/battleDataStructure.txt
data/client-README.txt
